cement.\n\nHowever, some critical elements are also anonymized by the government, due to the privacy issue.\n\nConclusion\tIn this paper, we explore the task of predicting judgments of civil cases.\n\nA more general and larger dataset will\n\nbenefit the research on judgment prediction.",
